 :affected-backends [:shared :datomic :datahike :datascript]
 :root-cause
 "Generated-authoritative can? always initialized the forward indexed traversal from the subject. A point query is anchored by one resource, but forward evaluation can enumerate every resource reachable from a broad subject before finding that target. Making generated authority the release default therefore changed a target-local authorization check into work proportional to subject fanout."
 :fix
 "Anchor every point check at the concrete target. Recursive roots initialize the verified reverse indexed traversal and use its Boolean renderer. Certified acyclic roots use the exact inclusive bound-probe source specialization instead of entering the recursive state machine. Add direction/classification regressions and a 16-versus-1,040 reachable-resource logical/backend-work gate."
 :closing-evidence
 ["eacl.formal.state-trace-differential-test/generated-decisions-and-source-specialized-acyclic-paths-preserve-order-and-point-locality"
  "eacl.bench.pagination-test/permission-check-benchmark"
  "IndexedReverseCompleteness.ExhaustedReverseTraversalRefinesLeastFixedPoint"
  "IndexedTraversal.ReadRenderResult"]}
